@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #466482
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #9AA8B8
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #334155
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #94A3B8
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam sequenceParticipantPadding 18
skinparam maxMessageSize 240
hide footbox
autonumber
!include course-notation.iuml
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor transparent
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor transparent
title B 改进业务序列：工时结算

participant "<$worker>\n内部成员" as W
participant "<$worker>\n部门部长" as M
participant "<$worker>\n办公部长" as O
participant "<$entity>\n工时与结算台账" as S
note over S
正常完成的任务已生成规则贡献。
end note
W -> S : 登记例外工作或查询个人明细
M -> S : 提交核定值及原因
activate S
S -> S : 保留原值、新值、操作者和时间
S --> M : 核定回执
deactivate S
O -> S : 按日期与人员筛选结算明细
S --> O : 含任务备注、调整原因的Excel
O -> S : 确认结算范围并封存
activate S
S -> S : 保存不可变行快照
S --> O : 封存批次与快照明细
deactivate S
legend bottom
后续实时工时可调整，已封存快照不变。
教师与外部只保留业务记录，不进入计酬明细。
endlegend

@enduml
